{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"change_kind\":\"DECOMPOSITION\",\"children\":[{\"assumptions\":[\"The selected control is evaluated only for a classified licensed firm and an actual STR filing.\",\"Unknown facts remain unknown rather than being treated as false.\",\"Footnote 3 attaches to the XML and prescribed-PDF items because those items carry the marker; the web-form item does not carry it.\",\"The filing is assessed at or after the operational launch time stated in the source.\"],\"citations\":[{\"quote\":\"With effect from 2 February 2026, STREAMS 2 will become the only channel for filing STRs2. Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\"},{\"quote\":\"(a) submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003\"},{\"quote\":\"(b) uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078\"},{\"quote\":\"(c) completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149\"},{\"quote\":\"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569\"},{\"quote\":\"licensed firms that intend to submit STRs via the XML format are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439\"}],\"distinction\":\"This child repairs the undeclared XML-method fact while preserving the post-launch channel and method requirements. It does not decide blackout-period handling or any resubmission deadline.\",\"family\":\"scope\",\"formalization\":{\"facts\":[{\"meaning\":\"The actor belongs to one of the classes collectively called licensed firms.\",\"name\":\"is_licensed_firm\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u0.0\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean classification\"},{\"meaning\":\"The event is an actual STR filing to the JFIU.\",\"name\":\"is_str_filing\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\",\"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941\",\"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean event classification\"},{\"meaning\":\"The filing occurs at or after the 9:00am operational launch on 2026-02-02.\",\"name\":\"at_or_after_operational_launch\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700\",\"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean temporal classification\"},{\"meaning\":\"The filing is made through STREAMS 2.\",\"name\":\"via_streams2\",\"requires_judgment\":false,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u3.811\",\"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean channel classification\"},{\"meaning\":\"The selected method is an XML submission.\",\"name\":\"is_xml_submission\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003\",\"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean method classification\"},{\"meaning\":\"The XML submission conforms to the separately provided JFIU XML schema.\",\"name\":\"xml_schema_conforms\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean technical conformity assessment\"},{\"meaning\":\"The selected method is a completed prescribed PDF upload.\",\"name\":\"is_completed_prescribed_pdf_upload\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean method classification\"},{\"meaning\":\"The selected method is completion of the STREAMS 2 web form.\",\"name\":\"is_completed_streams2_web_form\",\"requires_judgment\":false,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean method classification\"},{\"meaning\":\"The footnote 3 Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement is met for the assessed XML or PDF submission.\",\"name\":\"submission_ecert_requirement_met\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003\",\"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078\",\"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean certificate-requirement assessment\"}],\"result\":\"(and via_streams2 (or (and is_xml_submission xml_schema_conforms submission_ecert_requirement_met) (and is_completed_prescribed_pdf_upload submission_ecert_requirement_met) is_completed_streams2_web_form))\",\"result_type\":\"bool\",\"scope\":\"(and is_licensed_firm is_str_filing at_or_after_operational_launch)\"},\"local_id\":\"post_launch_channel_method\",\"questions\":[],\"statement\":\"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within the selected scope, true means the filing uses STREAMS 2 and one listed method, with XML schema conformity where XML is used and the footnote 3 e-Cert requirement met for XML or PDF. False means this selected control is not satisfied; it does not decide whole-firm compliance or STR timeliness.\",\"subject\":\"Post-launch STR channel, method and certificate control\"},{\"assumptions\":[\"The source requires resubmission for an STR first submitted through a channel other than STREAMS 2 after STREAMS 2 implementation.\",\"The source does not specify the resubmission deadline or define implementation independently of the launch wording.\"],\"citations\":[{\"quote\":\"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2. The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334\"}],\"distinction\":\"This is a separate resubmission obligation. The quoted source does not supply a deadline, completion condition beyond re-submission via STREAMS 2, or a complete formal relation for timing.\",\"family\":\"time\",\"formalization\":null,\"local_id\":\"off_channel_resubmission\",\"questions\":[\"What event or date constitutes implementation for purposes of the resubmission obligation?\",\"What deadline and required content govern re-submission?\",\"Does the obligation apply to urgent blackout-period contacts made by email, phone or fax?\"],\"statement\":\"Licensed firms are required to re-submit through STREAMS 2 any STR submitted through another channel following STREAMS 2 implementation.\",\"subject\":\"Post-implementation off-channel STR resubmission\"},{\"assumptions\":[\"The source creates a blackout-period exception allowing urgent STR matters to be communicated directly to JFIU.\"],\"citations\":[{\"quote\":\"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941\"},{\"quote\":\"the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2\",\"unit_id\":\"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700\"}],\"distinction\":\"The urgent-contact exception and its relationship to later STREAMS 2 filing are unresolved by the supplied text. No deadline or resubmission mechanics should be invented.\",\"family\":\"exceptions\",\"formalization\":null,\"local_id\":\"blackout_urgent_contact\",\"questions\":[\"Does an urgent email, phone or fax contact during the blackout period itself satisfy the reporting obligation temporarily?\",\"Must every such urgent matter later be re-submitted through STREAMS 2?\",\"If so, by what deadline and using which record or reference?\"],\"statement\":\"During the stated blackout period, urgent STR matters may be raised directly with JFIU by the listed contact methods; the source does not fully specify the later filing consequences.\",\"subject\":\"Blackout-period urgent STR contact exception\"}],\"obligations\":[{\"child_ids\":[\"post_launch_channel_method\"],\"explanation\":\"The parent statement is preserved as the post-launch STREAMS 2 channel and method control, with the missing XML-method fact declared.\",\"parent_item\":\"statement\",\"treatment\":\"PRESERVED\"},{\"child_ids\":[\"post_launch_channel_method\"],\"explanation\":\"The licensed-firm and STR-filing scope assumptions are retained in the child scope.\",\"parent_item\":\"assumption.0\",\"treatment\":\"PRESERVED\"},{\"child_ids\":[\"post_launch_channel_method\",\"off_channel_resubmission\",\"blackout_urgent_contact\"],\"explanation\":\"Unknown-facts treatment is retained across all children.\",\"parent_item\":\"assumption.1\",\"treatment\":\"PRESERVED\"},{\"child_ids\":[\"post_launch_channel_method\"],\"explanation\":\"The footnote allocation is retained for XML and prescribed PDF only.\",\"parent_item\":\"assumption.2\",\"treatment\":\"PRESERVED\"},{\"child_ids\":[\"post_launch_channel_method\"],\"explanation\":\"The launch-time implementation reading is retained as an explicit assumption of the post-launch child.\",\"parent_item\":\"question.0\",\"treatment\":\"PRESERVED\"},{\"child_ids\":[\"off_channel_resubmission\",\"blackout_urgent_contact\"],\"explanation\":\"The urgent-contact and later-resubmission issue remains unresolved and is split into focused questions.\",\"parent_item\":\"question.1\",\"treatment\":\"UNRESOLVED\"}],\"original_hash\":\"fcc6d678b497c072a9a51d58ebc13d55a5d36024cec275c5e34f6e90f124c16d\",\"parent_relation\":\"The parent formalization is decomposed into (i) the post-launch channel, method, schema and e-Cert control, (ii) the separate off-channel resubmission obligation, and (iii) the blackout-period urgent-contact exception. The undeclared is_xml_submission fact is added as a substantive interface repair; unresolved timing and resubmission mechanics require authority.\",\"residual_questions\":[\"What authoritative JFIU guidance defines implementation for the resubmission clause?\",\"What deadline and mechanics apply to re-submission of blackout-period urgent STR matters?\"]}"}}
